Decisions are cards of kind decision, shown with a "D " marker. Proposed is
ready, accepted is done (in force), rejected and revoked are dropped with that
reason, superseded is dropped when a newer decision replaces it. Accepted text
is frozen: record a new decision with 'decide --supersedes N'.

Examples:
  lorvik decisions ls --status ready
  lorvik decisions search "queue backend"
  lorvik decisions show 7
  lorvik decisions accept 8
  lorvik decisions link 7 42

Usage
  lorvik decisions [flags]
  lorvik decisions [command]

Commands
  accept      Accept a proposed decision
  edit        Edit a proposed decision's title or sections
  link        Apply a decision to a card
  ls          List decisions, newest first
  reject      Reject a proposed decision
  revoke      Revoke an accepted decision
  search      Search decisions
  show        Show one decision in full
  unlink      Remove a decision from a card

Flags
  -h, --help   help for decisions

Global flags
      --api-url string   Server URL (default: LORVIK_API_URL)
      --json             Output the raw API JSON
  -p, --project string   Project slug (default: LORVIK_PROJECT or .lorvik.toml)
  -Q, --quiet            Suppress the unread notice on stderr and an empty inbox
      --session string   Session label for this chat (default: LORVIK_SESSION or derived; see lorvik session)

Run 'lorvik decisions <command> --help' for more information about a command.
